TITLE: 1.2 System overview
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS has undergone comprehensive testing for safety-critical, real-time, and secure military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for test results.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers test results, referenced documents, test results, and requirements traceability per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports test validation and compliance.
