[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 3. Test results
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-003-MILUAV
TITLE: Unit Test Results
STATEMENT: All software components passed unit testing with 100% code coverage, including boundary conditions, error handling, and performance requirements.
RATIONALE: Unit test results ensure individual component reliability.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-004-MILUAV
TITLE: Integration Test Results
STATEMENT: Component integration testing verified interface compatibility, data flow, and system behavior under normal and fault conditions with 100% pass rate.
RATIONALE: Integration test results ensure system interoperability.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-005-MILUAV
TITLE: System Test Results
STATEMENT: System testing validated end-to-end functionality, performance requirements, security requirements, and safety requirements in operational scenarios with 100% pass rate.
RATIONALE: System test results validate complete system operation.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-006-MILUAV
TITLE: Flight Test Results
STATEMENT: Flight testing in controlled environments validated autonomous flight, mission execution, and emergency procedures with 100% pass rate.
RATIONALE: Flight test results validate real-world operational capabilities.
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-007-MILUAV
TITLE: Security Test Results
STATEMENT: Security testing included penetration testing, vulnerability assessment, and cryptographic validation per military security standards with 100% pass rate.
RATIONALE: Security test results ensure protection against threats.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 4. Requirements traceability
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-008-MILUAV
TITLE: Test Traceability
STATEMENT: All test cases were traceable to software requirements with bidirectional traceability maintained throughout the testing process with 100% coverage.
RATIONALE: Test traceability ensures complete requirements validation.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 5. Notes
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-009-MILUAV
TITLE: Test Documentation
STATEMENT: All test results were documented with detailed reports, including test procedures, results, issues, and recommendations for military compliance.
RATIONALE: Test documentation ensures auditability and compliance.
[[/SECTION]]

